<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Spanish first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>25 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>23 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>19 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>16 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>15 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao, Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>13 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcelona), Corentin Martins (Deportivo Coruna), Juan</p>
<p>Eduardo Esnaider (Atletico Madrid), Manuel Alfaro</p>
<p>(Hercules)</p>
<p>12 - Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Victor Fernandez</p>
<p>(Valladolid), Lyuboslav Penev (Compostela), Ismael Urzaiz</p>
<p>(Athletic Bilbao.</p>
</text>
